{"type":"message","id":"2e6037a9","parentId":"056e7e35","timestamp":"2026-04-17T20:12:28.721Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The supervision table (BMWPb0n1RapmFusxHe1c0mFmnab) has empty single-select options and no meaningful records. It seems to be an older/legacy table that is no longer in active use.\n\nNow let me update the heartbeat and check the task supervision. But wait - the supervision table appears to be empty. Let me look at what I know:\n\nThe daily notes mention a \"任务看板\" (task kanban) with various records. Let me check the Kdc4biRCqalOogs2NCScAdKDnhf (酒店AI native进度复盘日志) as well, since it appeared in the earlier notes.\n\nActually, the daily notes mention checking \"看板\" with task counts like 54 tasks. \n\nLooking back at the 18:11 check, I'm trying to reconcile those task counts - the DeerFlow kanban showed 7 total records, the AI协作表 had 6, and the multi-agent collaboration showed 4 entries, but the daily notes indicate 54 tasks in the kanban. There's a discrepancy I need to investigate further, possibly by checking the Kdc4biRCqalOogs2NCScAdKDnhf table since the TeIZbungWasADfsKcnjcogmMnCd table isn't returning visible fields. and the last heartbeat was recorded at 19:11 UTC on April 17th. The task records I'm seeing appear to be historical entries from March, so I need to check the actual kanban task table and the 酒店AI native进度复盘日志 to find the current 54-task count mentioned in the notes.\n\nLooking at what I've already reviewed, I can see the self-research kanban has 7 tasks with the earliest from March, and the AI collaboration table shows 6 tasks that are all in pending or in-progress states. The multi-AI collaboration tracking shows 4 AIs with small in progress at 40% and the others pending. Let me examine the DeerFlow专项研究看板 more closely to reconcile the total task count.\n\nNow I need to set up the heartbeat mechanism and establish a 60-minute timeout system for dead tasks, then compile the progress summary into the shared pool."},{"type":"text","text":"Now let me update my heartbeat and record the check in memory:\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_sph936vgeybk_1","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/memory/heartbeat-state.json","content":"{\n  \"last_heartbeat\": \"2026-04-17T20:11:00Z\",\n  \"instance\": \"小柱\",\n  \"status\": \"活跃\",\n  \"auto_check_job_id\": \"53656e40-4892-4759-a73e-a11dc01082b5\"\n}\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776456737953,"responseId":"0631c7223151a101518aacd5153a5c9e"}}
